docs {
  # Delete Category
  
  Soft deletes a category (sets deleted_at timestamp).
  
  ## URL Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID | **Required** | Category ID |
  
  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": 200,
    "message": "Category deleted successfully",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
